WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.890
A Mysterious Invitation: The Masked Chef's Trap!

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:00.760
Are they okay for you, Meili?

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:02.710
They're so beautiful.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:06.020
I remember my mother liked flowers best.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.980
I believe she'll be very happy.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.000
Thank you.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.150
Great.

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.550
But Chef Zhou Yu is too ruthless.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.740
Today is your mother's death anniversary, right?

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.780
Why won't he

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.360
worship your mother with us?

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.660
Nevertheless.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:21.460
My father's mind

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.930
is full of cooking.

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:26.890
Let's get ready to go.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.200
Meili! Mao!

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:30.610
Hurry up. Come with me.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.920
We're about to go out.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:33.000
Stop talking.

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.640
Anyway, it's spectacular.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:35.460
What?

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.040
It's so beautiful.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.720
It's an ice sculpture.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.000
Zhou Yu is amazing.

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:15.110
The dragon that is surrounded by flowers

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.280
is soaring into the sky,

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.030
Meili,

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.020
is this ice sculpture for...

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.840
He made it for my mother in heaven.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:37.740
Father...

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.780
It's so great.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:49.820
Chef Zhou Yu said he wants to

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.030
sweep the tomb and worship with us.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.630
Looks like he actually

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.190
misses you mother so much.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.440
I feel like he became a different person
all of a sudden.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:03.050
Chef Zhou Yu is amazing.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:06.080
Yes. He’s on a totally different level of skills.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.620
I believe, in Guangzhou,

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:08.680
we can't find a chef

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:10.640
who's as good as Chef Zhou Yu now.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:12.330
But Mao,

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.810
what on earth is the relationship

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:14.950
between the ice sculpturing

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.630
and the taste of a dish?

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.000
Being delicious is not enough for

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:19.850
Chinese cuisine.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.820
(Taste Aroma Color Shape)
Only the dish which is good at

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.140
taste, aroma, color and shape at the same time

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:28.080
is a great dish.

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:30.700
And the master of all techniques

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.940
is the ice sculpturing.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:35.430
He's so amazing.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.160
As a chef of Yang Spring Restaurant,
he's so great.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.260
Mao's teacher

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.080
has a rude look.

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.650
I can't believe that he made this.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.740
I'm a little bit surprised.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.430
To put it bluntly,

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.500
my father is just a man addicted to cooking.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.510
His enthusiasm for cooking

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.610
is really serious and strict.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.560
It seems that a lot of things happened
when he was young.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:04:59.970
A lot of things?

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.330
I know.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.350
It's easy to tell his character from his look.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:14.290
Looks like

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.520
the weather is going to change soon.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.570
OK. Let's go before

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.230
the weather turns bad.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.230
OK.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.860
Now I'm going to inform others about it.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:26.840
Sis,

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:27.570
come with me

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.700
and help me move that ice sculpture.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.390
I already told you

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:32.860
not to call me sister again.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.130
I found a big peach for making desserts.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.060
I can sacrifice it in front of the tomb.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.820
Here we go again!

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:42.020
Guys, we're leaving.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.500
Stop!

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:44.690
You have such a big ass.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.180
You can't catch me.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:46.780
Bastard!

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.070
They're hopeless.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:48.900
I won't forgive you today.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:50.770
Stop!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.520
Why should I stop?

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.330
What on earth is it?

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.320
I've caught you!

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:03.080
Sister, look.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.960
It's a letter for my father and me.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.640
Hope you two can take the time to

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.950
come to the Western-style Mansion
in front of the Haizhong Park tonight.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.280
I've prepared a banquet with

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.360
haute cuisine which is made of

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.280
fresh seasonal vegetables and meat here.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.390
I sincerely look forward to your visit.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.330
It's an invitation to the banquet.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.760
I'm so envious of you.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:31.970
But it's very weird.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:33.830
The Western-style Mansion

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:35.990
should have been in ruins since a long time ago.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:36.970
Ruins?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.000
Who sent it?

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.830
This mark.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.810
Since it got this mark on it,

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.860
you have no choice but to go there.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:54.750
Chef Ruoh.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.830
What's the meaning of this mark?

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:00.410
In Guangzhou Cooking Society,

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:03.080
this mark means complete obedience.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:06.110
But my father is not the only person he invited.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:07.980
Why did he invite me as well?

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.650
It seems weird.

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.430
Besides, it came with an arrow.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:12.830
Mao,

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.050
could you please go there with me?

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:16.110
But...

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:16.810
Mao,

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:19.560
go there with her.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:20.630
Yes.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:21.570
Great!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:22.620
Since my teacher Mao will go there,

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.680
of course I should go there, too.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:26.230
- You should stay in the restaurant to help others.
- Great!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.650
How can you do that to me?

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:30.560
How can you leave me alone?

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.060
I occasionally want to eat

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.060
something delicious!

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:33.850
Don't behave like

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.780
you never eat anything good in your daily life.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.860
It seems that this place is a bit weird, Meili.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:45.650
Right.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.440
It's dark in this area

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.190
even in the daytime.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.070
Nobody dares to come here.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.040
An unknown invitation to the banquet.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:56.770
I don't know what's going on.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:06.610
We've arrived.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.380
This is the Western-style Mansion?

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.240
It looks like a haunted house.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.250
Is there anyone inside?

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.180
Father,

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:23.340
I think we'd better go back.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:34.500
Thank you for coming.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.400
Well, please come in with me.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.430
All of them are important people of
the Guangzhou Cooking Society.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.990
They also received invitations.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.750
Who on earth invited everyone here?

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.060
The more I think about it,
the weirder it becomes.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.630
Representatives of the Guangzhou Cooking Society,

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.360
thank you so much for coming here.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.590
Tonight,

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:16.840
please enjoy

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:20.090
the feast prepared by our host.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:33.000
This guy has good taste and great cooking skills.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.580
It's so delicious.

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.040
Although I don't know who's the chef,

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.650
his cooking skills are amazing.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:04.300
Here comes the main course tonight.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.910
The main course? What's it?

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:08.040
Help yourself.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:13.650
This is the Stir-fried Pigeon Meat with Oyster Sauce.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:15.870
Oyster sauce.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.690
Stir-fried pigeon meat.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.800
OK. I'm going to eat it.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:25.660
(Delicious)
It's delicious!

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.460
It's so great to match it with vegetables!

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:32.870
This taste is really special.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.200
(Delicacy)
I think the oyster sauce is not the only seasoning.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.440
(Delicacy)
There seem to be some special spices.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:41.260
It's true.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.360
There is no unique gamy taste

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.780
of the pigeon meat.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:44.790
It's a bit spicy.

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.250
It's so delicious!

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:51.790
This taste...

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:54.680
Don't eat it!

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.860
Guys, don't eat this dish!

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:00.620
Why?

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.280
It's really rare to find pigeon meat

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:04.110
as delicious as this.

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:06.320
It's not pigeon meat!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.730
What are you talking about, kid?

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:08.680
As a layman,

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.140
what do you know about cooking?

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.330
You idiot!

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:13.950
Mao is right.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:21.540
Meili!

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:22.290
What's wrong?

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:23.480
Meili! Meili!

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.440
I'm paralyzed.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.210
Somebody...

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.680
Somebody help!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:41.930
Mao!

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:43.750
Meili!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:47.060
Hang in there.

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:47.600
Meili!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.760
Meili. Meili!

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:51.450
Meili!

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:53.480
I'm right.

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:54.380
It's the virulent true fog meat.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.240
Yes. It tastes almost the same as the pigeon meat.

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.540
After seasoning it with spices,

00:11:58.590 --> 00:11:59.960
people will believe it's pigeon meat.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:04.220
Why? What on earth is the purpose of that guy?

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.000
What's going on with this room?

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:26.840
Who? Who are you?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.920
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:49.280
The mask.

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:51.950
You made that dish, right?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.210
It's been a long time, Zhou Yu.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:56.760
What?

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:07.320
Who on earth are you?

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:10.710
Don't you remember me?

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.330
This voice...

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:13.530
No way.

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:15.730
You're still alive.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:16.980
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.690
You seduced me into coming here
with a boring letter.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.460
In the end, the main course of the dinner

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.200
is a poisonous dish made of true fog meat.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:25.840
What on earth is your purpose?

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:40.070
I want revenge.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.810
Zhou Yu, the reason why
I tried hard to live till today

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.630
is that I want to take revenge on you.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.390
He said he wants revenge.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.570
What happened between them?

00:13:58.570 --> 00:13:59.850
Have a showdown with me, Zhou Yu.

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:02.060
You can't refuse.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.800
Your daughter has been poisoned
with a great toxicant.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.520
If she doesn't drink the antidote
before all the blood

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:19.910
of the blood timer drops down,

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.100
she'll die.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:23.840
If you don't defeat me,

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:26.170
you won't get this antidote.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.900
This... This guy is too contemptible.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.830
Once it's related to your daughter's life,

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.570
you have to accept the challenge, Zhou Yu.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.600
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:51.770
Don't worry.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:53.250
Take care of Meili.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.440
What do you want to compete in?

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:04.430
Can a duck swim?

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:07.910
The Three-round Lobster Competition like before.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.780
Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.620
Before?

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.510
Let's use lobsters to

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.260
compete in a three-round competition.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.380
I think you still remember that.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.910
At first, we need to compare our knife skills.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:46.480
Disassemble lobsters.

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:49.820
There is an extra condition.

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:12.540
Are they going to blindfold themselves?

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.080
We must blindfold ourselves and

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.370
make the lobster platter
based on our feelings in darkness.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:24.140
So horrible.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.290
It's really an intense competition.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.930
But Chef Zhou Yu will not lose.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.150
He has the best knife skills of Guangzhou.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:35.280
Why

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.780
do you still want to
hold a boring competition now?

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.270
How dare you ask me?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.340
First, I'd like to announce that

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.580
no matter how many times you compete with me,

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.960
you can't defeat me.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.370
Nonesense!

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:52.920
Zhou Yu, you've always been like that.

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.810
You always look down on me.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.630
But I've already changed.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.060
By the way, don't forget that

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.080
your daughter's life

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:05.800
is indeed controlled by me.

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.350
Enough. Let's get started.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.200
It's the same tone again.

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:11.500
Your tone

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.830
will only increase my hatred for you.

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:14.750
Zhou Yu,

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.500
you have a slim chance to win now.

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.860
I don't think so.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:34.170
They started.

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:36.960
A knife skill competition in darkness.

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.180
What a bold knife skill!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.670
He cuts the lobster so fast
without making any mistakes.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.180
Amazing!

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:21.340
No matter in what situation,

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:22.760
his knife skills are always as usual.

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:24.540
Chef Zhou Yu is so great.

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:45.660
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.330
Chef Zhou Yu!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:02.630
Chef Zhou Yu. Chef Zhou Yu. Hang in there.
Chef Zhou Yu!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.070
What's wrong?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.700
What on earth happened?

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.220
Scorpion.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:11.840
Crap!

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:16.690
What's up, Zhou Yu? Did you give up?

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:19.640
Where is the chef's spirit that

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:20.510
you're always proud of?

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.320
It's not like you at all.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:23.790
Look at me.

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.620
I've already completed

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.070
the Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.170
Because you gave up halfway,

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:32.500
it seems that I won.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:36.830
No, you haven't won!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:38.780
You resorted to such a despicable means

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:39.860
to win.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:41.540
Despicable?

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:43.220
Yes.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.270
It was you

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.710
who put scorpions and lobsters together!

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.880
Kid, you said I'm contemptible.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.160
Yes. You're a scumbag!

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:52.530
I'm gonna tell you the truth.

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:54.220
Your teacher

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:55.720
resorted to the same means to confront me

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.010
when we competed against each other that year.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.070
Yes, it was that day.

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:05.650
Zhou... Zhou Yu. You...

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:19.720
It... It's impossible.

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.080
I've already succeeded to take revenge on him.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:24.040
It's all over now.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.210
Zhou Yu, I want you to experience

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.080
the torture and the humiliation

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.370
I've been suffered since that time.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:37.560
I don't know what on earth you wanted to avenge.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.780
But you avenged it in the name of
cooking competition.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:41.830
You hurt not only Zhou Yu

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:43.100
but also Meili...

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.700
Hey. Wait a minute.

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:00.920
Are you going to give up?

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:02.650
What did you say?

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.010
Since it's a three-round competition,

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:10.410
there are still two rounds, right?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:11.670
What?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.220
Next,

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:14.980
as the best student of Chef Zhou Yu

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:16.640
and...

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:20.230
(Super)

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.900
As Super Chef Liu Maoxing,

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.470
I'll compete with you!

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:27.290
This punk!

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:17.493
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.493 --> 00:23:20.253
I can't let you do this,
I don't know what happened to you in the past,

00:23:20.253 --> 00:23:23.027
but what do you think
you're doing with these people's lives?

00:23:23.109 --> 00:23:26.730
Are you running away?
It's a contest between me and you.

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:26.739
Are you running away?
It's a contest between me and you.
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:26.739 --> 00:23:28.066
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:30.226
Inherited Spirit:

00:23:30.226 --> 00:23:32.327
Bloody Battle at the Western-style Mansion!!

00:23:32.327 --> 00:23:33.912
It will definitely be interesting!
